[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0075","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49901","title":"Linux 内核 blk-mq 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 blk-mq 块设备多队列子系统中存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。该漏洞源于 blk_mq_init_allocated_queue 函数在初始化硬件队列失败时，异常路径提前将 q->mq_ops 置空，导致 blk_release_queue 无法正确释放已分配的 hctx 结构体，从而造成内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过加载恶意块设备驱动模块（如 null_blk）触发此漏洞，持续利用可能导致系统内存资源耗尽，引发拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核主线版本，建议更新至包含补丁的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49901"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:27Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本（如 5.15.x / 6.1.x 系列中已合入此补丁的最新长期支持版本），或从 kernel.org 更新至包含 commit 补丁「blk-mq: call blk_release_queue in exception path」的内核。如无法立即升级，建议在受影响的系统上卸载 null_blk 模块（modprobe -r null_blk）并禁用自动加载，以消除 kmemleak 触发路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2dc97e15a54b7bdf457848aa8c663c98a24e58a6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/943f45b9399ed8b2b5190cbc797995edaa97f58f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49901.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49901.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49901.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49901","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-pmj7-4375-32j4/GHSA-pmj7-4375-32j4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49901.md","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49901","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49901.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-61715.json","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/zh/security-disclosure/2025/2025-08.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0074","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49858","title":"Linux kernel octeontx2-pf 驱动 SQE 阈值检查不当导致内存泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Marvell OcteonTX2 网络驱动 octeontx2-pf 中存在 SQE（发送队列条目）阈值检查缺陷，驱动基于硬件更新的 SQB 计数判断可用 SQE 数量，可能导致在 NAPI 处理完同一索引处先前发送的 SQE 对应的 CQE 之前就提交新的 SQE，造成 SKB 指针丢失进而引发内存泄漏。本地低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞触发系统拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49858"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:19Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.9 或更高版本，或 cherry-pick 提交 015e3c0a3b16193aab23beefe4719484b9984c2d（主线）及 f0dfc4c88ef39be0ba736aa0ce6119263fc19aeb（稳定分支）。如无法立即更新，可限制非授权用户对 Marvell OcteonTX2 网卡设备的本地访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/015e3c0a3b16193aab23beefe4719484b9984c2d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f0dfc4c88ef39be0ba736aa0ce6119263fc19aeb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49858.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49858.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49858","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49858.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49858.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-6chx-4cx4-vrw4/GHSA-6chx-4cx4-vrw4.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49858.html","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/scraped_data/first/CVE-2022-49858","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49858.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0073","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49833","title":"Linux Kernel btrfs 分区设备克隆时空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统的 zoned 模式中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当在分区设备（zoned device）上克隆 btrfs_device 结构体时，未能同时克隆关联的 btrfs_zoned_device_info 结构体，导致后续访问设备的 zone_info（如将区域设置为 active 状态）时触发空指针解引用。本地攻击者可通过挂载特制的分区文件系统触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响使用 Btrfs zoned 模式的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49833"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:15Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.9 或更高版本（修复提交 21e61ec6d0bb、ad88cabcec94），或向后移植这两个补丁至当前内核。该漏洞仅影响使用 zoned 模式（主机管理/主机感知式 SMR 硬盘）的 btrfs 文件系统，若未使用此类设备则不受影响；受影响的系统应优先升级内核，无法立即升级时避免在 SMR 设备上启用 btrfs 的 zoned 模式作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/21e61ec6d0bb786818490e926aa9aeb4de95ad0d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad88cabcec942c033f980cd1e28d56ecdaf5f3b8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49833.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49833.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49833","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49833.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49833.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-qq9j-c8r5-5xf6/GHSA-qq9j-c8r5-5xf6.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49833.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49833","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69917.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b1580542-4260-4526-a9bc-cd74b03fae4d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0072","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49829","title":"Linux 内核 DRM 调度程序围栏引用计数漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 调度器（drm/scheduler）中存在围栏引用计数漏洞，当使用 DRM 的进程被异常终止时，依赖围栏未正确释放引用，导致内存泄漏。攻击者可通过运行大量使用 DRM 图形渲染的进程，触发资源耗尽，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核的 DRM 子系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49829"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:14Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.10 及以上版本。该漏洞影响内核 4.18 至 6.0.10 之前版本，修复提交为 e5f4b38362df 和 b3af84383e7a，位于 drivers/gpu/drm/scheduler/sched_entity.c。无法立即升级时，可通过限制本地用户对 DRM 子系统的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3af84383e7abdc5e63435817bb73a268e7c3637","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5f4b38362df93594cb426b04979d8834122f159","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49829.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49829.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49829","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49829.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49829.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-g46r-j95v-9f3q/GHSA-g46r-j95v-9f3q.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49829","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69914.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--70db82ca-fa50-4ffc-b65c-d4904a35eebe.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/31888ebfccb52a8f5a185d0c09b4e68a7521575c/2022/CVE-2022-49829.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0071","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49810","title":"Linux kernel netfs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfs 库在 RCU 读锁保护下遍历 xarray 时，缺少 xas_retry() 调用检查，导致迭代器可能返回 xarray 内部特殊标记值而非有效指针，访问该值会触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 netfs 的 Linux 内核版本（如 ceph 等网络文件系统），本地攻击者可通过构造特定文件读取操作序列触发此条件竞争，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49810"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:12Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.78、5.16.4 或更高版本（含对应 LTS 分支修复），该修复已合入主线并回移植各稳定分支。如无法升级内核，可禁用 netfs 相关功能（如减少 ceph 文件系统使用）作为临时缓解措施，但不推荐长期使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7e043a80b5dae5c2d2cf84031501de7827fd6c00","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b2cc07a76f1eb12de3b22caf5fdbf856a7bef16d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49810.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49810.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49810","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49810.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49810.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-5qqg-7vmr-gjg2/GHSA-5qqg-7vmr-gjg2.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49810.html","https://github.com/Alexandre-gng/ANSSI_alerts/blob/70d44ad0e93bb331b572bd411ab72438068e6dba/scraped_data/first/CVE-2022-49810","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--26d937c5-05ed-43d7-91fc-6e897d8f5260.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49810.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0070","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49803","title":"Linux Kernel netdevsim 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netdevsim 驱动中存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401），当用户通过 debugfs 接口向 `nsim_dev_trap_fa_cookie_write()` 函数写入 fa_cookie 时，分配的内存在设备移除过程（`nsim_drv_remove()`）中未被释放。本地攻击者可反复写入 fa_cookie 触发内存泄漏，最终导致系统内存耗尽引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49803"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:16:03Z","updated":"2026-07-04T12:16:51Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1 及以上版本，或打补丁至 5.10.260/5.15.209/6.0.10 稳定版。修复在 `nsim_drv_remove()` 中添加 `kfree(nsim_dev->fa_cookie)` 释放已分配内存。作为临时缓解措施，可卸载 netdevsim 内核模块（`rmmod netdevsim`）避免触发内存泄漏。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/064bc7312bd09a48798418663090be0c776183db","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/207edad5717e0a5709ce8467f0eff41c607835c9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6d463ddd0107d4188229d996dcdd45c99bad8af7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7d79725a7073d86b9185f87718e22f3d65115801","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49803.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49803.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49803","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49803.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49803.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-whrx-8qvw-6p89/GHSA-whrx-8qvw-6p89.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49803.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49803","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5fc355d60e5d1a1fefefacd0202b767223ed6ef1/usn/8576-1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49803.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0069","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49766","title":"Linux Kernel netlink 内存越界写入漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netlink 子系统中存在越界写入漏洞，在创建 `nlmsgerr` 结构体时未对灵活数组成员进行边界检查，导致 `memcpy()` 可能跨复合灵活数组结构写入超 32 字节数据（目的字段仅 16 字节），触发运行时缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可利用 `NETLINK` 套接字发送特制的错误消息触发该漏洞，导致内存敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.5，影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49766"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:05Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.17 以上版本，具体包含提交 f6b3051e9adbe (netlink: Bounds-check struct nlmsgerr creation) 的内核已修复此问题。对于无法升级内核的生产环境，可通过启用 FORTIFY_SOURCE 编译选项（-D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=2）并在 sysctl 中限制 netlink 访问权限（kernel.dmesg_restrict=1）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/710d21fdff9a98d621cd4e64167f3ef8af4e2fd1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aff4eb16f589c3af322a2582044bca365381fcd6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49766.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49766.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49766","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49766.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49766.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-qqpc-5fw9-5q24/GHSA-qqpc-5fw9-5q24.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49766.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-49766","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69719.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49766.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0068","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49764","title":"Linux 内核 BPF 原始追踪探针程序递归拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF（Berkeley Packet Filter）子系统中存在程序递归调用漏洞。当 BPF 程序作为原始跟踪点附加到 contention_begin 跟踪点时，程序内部调用 bpf_trace_printk 辅助函数会再次触发同一跟踪点，导致无限递归，进而引发内核警告、锁竞争加剧及栈溢出风险。本地攻击者需具备 BPF 程序加载权限（通常需 root 权限）来触发该漏洞，可导致系统拒绝服务。Linux 内核社区已通过引入 BPF 程序 active 字段标志位，在程序已运行时跳过执行以避免递归，从而修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49764"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-01T15:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:05Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1 及以上版本（该漏洞在 6.1-rc1 中修复，commit 为内核 BPF 子系统的 \"Prevent bpf program recursion for raw tracepoint probes\" 补丁），或向后移植该补丁到所使用的 LTS 内核分支。如无法立即升级，应避免将调用 bpf_trace_printk 等可能触发锁机制的 BPF 程序附加到 contention_begin 等原始跟踪探针上，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/05b24ff9b2cfabfcfd951daaa915a036ab53c9e1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e5399879024fedd6cdc41f73fbf9bbe7208f899","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49764.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49764.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49764","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49764.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49764.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-7wj3-cv8c-chpx/GHSA-7wj3-cv8c-chpx.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49764.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49764","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-69716.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9291f458-82e3-4daa-b0b8-b16ce8aaf2e5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0067","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49750","title":"Linux 内核 cpufreq CPPC 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 cpufreq 子系统的 CPPC（协作处理器性能控制）驱动中存在整数溢出漏洞。_CPC ACPI 对象中的字段为 32 位无符号整数，驱动在进行频率转换和性能计算时未将中间运算结果显式转换为 u64 类型，导致乘法运算可能发生整数回绕，产生错误的频率值并引发内核行为异常。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特定的性能状态触发溢出，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.19 至 6.1.9 之前的版本及 6.2-rc 系列。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49750"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:02Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：主线内核 ≥ v5.17-rc7，或长期支持分支中对应的修复版本（如 v5.15.101+、v5.10.164+、v5.4.231+）。无法立即升级时，可通过内核启动参数 `cpufreq.off=1` 临时禁用 cpufreq CPPC 驱动作为缓解措施，但会降低 CPU 频率调节能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7d596bbc66a52ff2c7a83d7e0ee840cb07e2a045","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f5f94b9c8b805d87ff185caf9779c3a4d07819e3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49750.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49750.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49750.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49750","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49750.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-v985-xp9j-wxfh/GHSA-v985-xp9j-wxfh.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49750","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2022-49750.md","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-60322.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49750.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0066","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49742","title":"Linux f2fs 文件系统锁初始化顺序不当导致内核锁依赖警告漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 F2FS 文件系统驱动中的 `f2fs_fill_super()` 函数存在锁初始化顺序缺陷，在错误处理路径中 `spin_lock(&sbi->error_lock)` 被调用时该锁尚未通过 `spin_lock_init()` 完成初始化，导致内核 lockdep 报出锁依赖警告。本地攻击者可通过挂载特制 F2FS 文件系统镜像触发该错误路径，引发内核信息泄露或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49742"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:19:01Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.9 或更高稳定版本（6.x/7.x），该补丁已在上游主线中合入，可通过发行版包管理器（如 apt upgrade linux-image / yum update kernel）更新。若暂无法升级内核，可考虑禁用 f2fs 文件系统挂载作为临时缓解措施，避免触发漏洞路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/92b4cf5b48955a4bdd15fe4e2067db8ebd87f04c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ddeff03bb33810fcf2f0c18e03d099cf0aacda62","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49742.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49742.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49742.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2022-49742","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49742.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-88rq-q8gm-2chx/GHSA-88rq-q8gm-2chx.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49742","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2022-49742.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49742.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-60306.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0065","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49728","title":"Linux IPv6 __ip6_append_data 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 IPv6 协议栈中的 __ip6_append_data 函数存在符号整数溢出漏洞，该函数将 length 变量定义为 int 类型，在计算附加数据长度时（如 2147479552 + 8567）超出 int 表示范围，导致整数溢出。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的 sendmsg 调用触发该溢出，造成内核行为不可预测，可能导致系统崩溃或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.16 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 社区已通过将 length 变量类型改为 size_t 修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49728"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.6、5.15.180 或 5.10.236 及以上版本，各稳定分支已分别包含修复 commit f93431c86b63。该漏洞为 __ip6_append_data 函数中 length 变量使用有符号 int 类型导致整数上溢，攻击者可利用特制 IPv6 报文触发拒绝服务。如无法立即升级内核，可执行 sysctl -w net.ipv6.conf.all.disable_ipv6=1 并写入 /etc/sysctl.conf 禁用 IPv6 协议栈作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/70549c80fe80ac4e2a22068c76ebebced24f7e74","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/84dc940890e91e42898e4443a093281702440abf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f26422eabeb517629568edf8c2dd9c6cb9147584","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f93431c86b631bbca5614c66f966bf3ddb3c2803","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-49728.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49728.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49728.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49728","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/430f582ded680f823d28636f80d8cb58f1c3d8cd/2022/CVE-2022-49728.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2022-49728-2025-11-03-1334","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49728.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-cwf6-gj87-3ghq/GHSA-cwf6-gj87-3ghq.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-49728-ipv6-fix-signed-integer-overflow-in-1771408310000.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49728"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0064","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49722","title":"Linux 内核 Intel ice 网卡 VF 驱动内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ice 网卡驱动在处理虚拟功能（VF）重置时存在内存破坏漏洞。当 VF 请求复位时其 RX/TX 队列仍处于启用状态，而 PF 驱动误认为 VF 已禁用，导致 VF 提前释放 DMA 资源。此时设备仍可将数据包映射到已释放内存，造成静默内存损坏，最终可能触发内核崩溃或权限提升。攻击者可通过物理功能（PF）触发 VF 重置操作利用此漏洞，影响使用 Intel ice 系列网卡且启用 SR-IOV 的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49722"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到 5.18.6 及以上版本（包含修复 commit 1bb8253b1dd44c / efe41860008e57f）。使用发行版内核的用户请安装对应厂商安全更新：RHEL/CentOS 8 更新 kernel 到含补丁版本，Ubuntu 更新 linux-image 到最新。如无法升级内核，可在 BIOS 层面临时禁用 SR-IOV 或不在 PF/VF 间动态重置 VF 作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1bb8253b1dd44cf004e12c333acc6f25ee286cf3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/efe41860008e57fb6b69855b4b93fdf34bc42798","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49722.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49722","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49722.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49722.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49722.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49722.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-h43m-2hvj-4frc/GHSA-h43m-2hvj-4frc.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49722","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68805.json","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0063","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49699","title":"Linux Linux内核 filemap 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核文件映射子系统（filemap）中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当并发读取操作与缓存失效操作产生竞态条件时，folio 可能被替换为更高阶的 folio，导致在 filemap_get_read_batch() 函数的下一次循环迭代中出现兄弟条目（sibling entry），进而引发在持有 RCU 读锁期间的空指针解引用。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发系统崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49699"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:53Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.8 或更高版本（5.18.x 用户升级至 5.18.8 即可；5.19 及以上版本已包含此修复）。对于 RHEL/CentOS 等发行版，请安装对应的内核安全更新。各长期支持 (LTS) 内核分支也已向后移植此修补（对应提交 cb995f4eeba9 / a66f131d30e5）。如无法立即更新内核，可通过 seccomp 或 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制非信任进程对 mmap 的调用以降低风险，但升级内核是唯一彻底的修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a66f131d30e53000f08301776bf85c912ef47aad","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb995f4eeba9d268fd4b56c2423ad6c1d1ea1b82","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49699.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49699.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49699","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49699.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49699.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-rqcf-mx7p-prjx/GHSA-rqcf-mx7p-prjx.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49699.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49699","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49699.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49699"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0062","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49651","title":"Linux Linux 内核释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SRCU（可睡眠 RCU）子系统的 cleanup_srcu_struct() 函数存在释放后使用漏洞。该函数仅检查了正在进行中的宽限期（GP），但未检测尚未启动但可能随时启动的宽限期，导致在并发场景下 SRCU 结构被提前释放后仍被引用，触发内存损坏。本地攻击者可通过加载特制模块利用此漏洞，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49651"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:45Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.11 及以上版本（5.18.x 系列）或 5.19+。对应修复提交：主线补丁 e997dda6502e，稳定分支补丁 8ed00760203d（已合入长期支持内核）。若无法立即升级，建议在未信任环境中限制本地用户访问权限作为临时缓解措施，因为该漏洞需要本地低权限访问才能触发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ed00760203d8018bee042fbfe8e076579be2c2b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e997dda6502eefbc1032d6b0da7b353c53344b07","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49651.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49651.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49651.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49651","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49651.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-jc9r-g3mj-xmwh/GHSA-jc9r-g3mj-xmwh.json","https://github.com/openharmony/docs/blob/f41b9345badd47c7ab0c263344cd7f4b5a549afb/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v4.1.4-release.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49651","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49651.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58971.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0061","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49636","title":"Linux kernel VLAN 子系统内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 VLAN 子系统的 `vlan_newlink()` 函数在处理 VLAN 接口创建时存在内存泄漏漏洞。当通过 `egress-qos-map` 参数指定多个优先级映射时，若后续内存分配失败，函数未能正确释放之前已成功分配的优先级映射内存，导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过多次创建 VLAN 接口触发此漏洞，造成系统内存资源耗尽，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 VLAN 相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49636"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:42Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.137 及以上、5.15.61 及以上或 5.19.17 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 commit 9bbd917e0bec 中修复。若无法立即升级，在创建 VLAN 接口时避免使用大量 egress-qos-map 参数作为临时规避措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c43069bb1097dd6cc1cf0f7c43a36d1f7b3910b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/549de58dba4bf1b2adc72e9948b9c76fa88be9d2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/72a0b329114b1caa8e69dfa7cdad1dd3c69b8602","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/df27729a4fe0002dfd80c96fe1c142829c672728","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f5dc10b910bdac523e5947336445a77066c51bf9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49636.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49636","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49636.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-49636.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49636.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-49636-vlan-fix-memory-leak-in-vlan-newlin-1771408807000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-46vm-5748-8g36/GHSA-46vm-5748-8g36.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49636","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5fc355d60e5d1a1fefefacd0202b767223ed6ef1/vex/usn/USN-7585-6.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58356.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0061.toml"}]